  "prefLabel": "En 1017.03 Annual Report Required Information Regarding Interconnection Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1017.03 Annual Report Required Information Regarding Interconnection Applications. The annual report shall include the following data regarding interconnection applications:\n\n(a) Total number of simplified process applications submitted in the reporting period as follows:\n\n(1) Total average processing time from complete application to contingent approval for applications completed in the reporting year;\n\n(2) Average net utility processing time from receipt of complete simplified process application to initial utility approval or contingent approval for applications completed in the reporting year; and\n\n(3) Average customer hold time for applications completed in the reporting year; and\n\n(b) Total number of fast track process applications submitted in the reporting period as follows:\n\n(1) Total average processing time from complete application to contingent approval for applications completed in the reporting year;\n\n(2) Average net utility processing time from receipt of complete fast track process applications to provision of contingent approval for applications that received contingent approval during the reporting period; and\n\n(3) Average customer hold time for applications completed in the reporting year.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
}
